<title>FRANCE: Gle des Eaux sets one bln Ffr bond.</title>
<headline>Gle des Eaux sets one bln Ffr bond.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by the lead manager to yield 49 basis points over comparable French government OATs at the reoffer price.</p>
<p>BORROWER - CIE GENERALE DES EAUX</p>
<p>LEAD MGR - SOCIETE GENERALE</p>
<p> AMT   ONE BLN FRF	COUPON     6.50	MATURITY 31.JAN.09</p>
<p> TYPE  STRAIGHT	   ISS PRICE  100.63    PAY DATE 31.JAN.97</p>
<p>				REOFFER    99.33</p>
<p>				PAY FREQ   ANNUAL</p>
<p> FULL FEES 1.7 PCT	SPREAD +49 BP</p>
<p>Note - The spread is over the 8.5 pct 2008 and 6.5 pct 2011 OATs</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
